<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine grain/oilseed stocks on January 1.</title>
<headline>Argentine grain/oilseed stocks on January 1.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine Agriculture Secretariat figures for domestic grain stocks on January 1 in tonnes, followed by figures for a month earlier and a year earlier:</p>
<p> Bread wheat    5,907,781	 2,543,083	 4,432,262</p>
<p> Maize		777,515	 1,189,705	   654,028</p>
<p> Sorghum	     78,169	    98,882	    31,305</p>
<p> Barley	     205,066	   172,997	     243,5</p>
</text>
